      paragraphs: <String>["A school group planned a day excursion to a small farm. The morning sky was clear, but dark clouds appeared during the coach ride. Their teacher checked the rain forecast and asked everyone to keep a waterproof coat nearby.", "At the farm entrance, heavy rain began. The group waited under a covered shelter while the farmer checked the muddy path. She offered an indoor visit to the barn instead of the outdoor tour, and the teacher agreed.", "Inside, the children watched the farmer prepare animal feed and learned where the grain came from. When the rain stopped, they put on rubber boots and took a short walk. Their wet clothes stayed in separate bags on the journey home, but everyone had enjoyed the change of plan."],
